OL,3,GNEWSASinger with cancer to switch on   
OL,4,AChristmas lights                       
OL,6,FA teenager who recorded a Christmas    
OL,7,Fsong to cheer up her family while      
OL,8,Fundergoing cancer treatment has been   
OL,9,Fchosen to switch on this year's festive
OL,10,Flights in Coalville.                   
OL,12,FBethany, who was diagnosed with        
OL,13,FNon-Hodgkin lymphoma in March 2025,    
OL,14,Fdecided to write a song and was then   
OL,15,Fgiven the chance to record it          
OL,16,Fprofessionally.                        
OL,18,FThe 15-year-old said she was "excited" 
OL,19,Fto be turning on the annual Christmas  
OL,20,Flights on Saturday, but also "nervous" 
OL,21,Fto sing her own songs.                 
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
