OL,3,GNEWSASinger with cancer to switch on   
OL,4,AChristmas lights                       
OL,6,FHer mother Rebecca said Bethany was    
OL,7,Fstill receiving chemotherapy but was   
OL,8,F"recovering well", and added that the  
OL,9,Ffamily was "proud" and "excited for    
OL,10,Fher" to be given the honour to switch  
OL,11,Fon the illuminations.                  
